What the Static C Launcher Actually Enforces: Scrubbing caller environment & inherited FDs; pure-C SHA-256 verification of script, config, manifest (G44-50), cred (G44-28), bash (fexecve), and pinned --bounded-run tools (fexecve(tool_fd), G44-49); sealed memfd immutability; per-call streaming byte/record/wall-clock caps.
